1
00:00:03,526 --> 00:00:08,167
Grim Reaper, you really know how to get on my nerves

2
00:00:09,403 --> 00:00:12,455
I'm not here to ingratiate myself with you

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,935
I kill merely because your deaths are necessary

4
00:00:17,319 --> 00:00:19,175
Oh, you've made that quite clear

5
00:00:19,815 --> 00:00:22,119
But humans don't take well to being scorned...

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,408
Not even by the gods!

7
00:01:06,821 --> 00:01:08,477
This is futile

8
00:01:09,384 --> 00:01:13,477
You must know that you are powerless against me in my own domain

9
00:01:13,875 --> 00:01:16,599
I suggest that you save your strength

10
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:20,350
For what? Maybe we can't change anything...

11
00:01:20,575 --> 00:01:21,964
But if nothing else

12
00:01:22,825 --> 00:01:25,516
We can at least teach you to have some respect for the dead!

13
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:27,452
Audacious

